## Scaffolding

This repo was bootstrapped with the devkit `bootstrap` verb. New entities and modules
should come from it too (`/devkit:bootstrap`): it keeps every layer, test and doc in the
shape described here. The agreed spec of each run is kept under `.bootstrap/`.
